        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/4bbf92/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-10T16:45:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What are the (if any) post OblivAeon&nbsp; Kickstarter release plans?&nbsp; Will the mini-expansions and alternate hero cards be available separately afterwords, or is this pretty the only time you will be able to get them?&nbsp; I'm just trying to get a feel for the future of Sentinels.&nbsp; I'm assuming, that while this is the last expansion, the game will remain in print for a while.&nbsp; So what of people who either lack the funds to Kickstart right now, or come to game late?&nbsp;&nbsp; Will there be any way to get this content later?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:32.923Z",
