        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-10T16:49:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Everything except the foil cards and canvas prints will be available post kickstarter. The OblivAeon promos (Ivana, Dark Watch Harpy etc) will not be available, outside of the all hero promo cards pack, but the mini expansions such as Stuntman and Benchmark should be.</p>",
