        "username": "Animus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/{size}/1887_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-10T17:19:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"pwatson1974\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/48/1925_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> pwatson1974:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Everything except the foil cards and canvas prints will be available post kickstarter. The OblivAeon promos (Ivana, Dark Watch Harpy etc) will not be available, outside of the all hero promo cards pack, but the mini expansions such as Stuntman and Benchmark should be.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>From the KS page: \" However, we want to make this a special thing for just this year, so we're only going to make enough to cover this Kickstarter plus a few hundred extras to sell at Gen Con and to retailers.\" So they will be available at Gen Con and some retailers may have a few, but that's it.&nbsp;</p>",
