        "created_at": "2016-02-10T17:28:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, there will be individual promos that are unlocked in this campaign (Omni U, Parse, etc) outside of the regular promo pack since they are strech goals for any pledge, including those that don't get the regular or foil variant pack. &nbsp;Those have typically been available to buy at conventions (or earn with Sentinels points)</p>",
